  "senders_milestone": "Stitchwork Sundays is having its first proper exhibition - the church hall booked for a fortnight, four clothes rails borrowed off the Tuesday market, forty memory quilts hung, and a guest book on a card table by the door.",
  "fusion_channel": "Menteith gave Stitchwork its first regular room when the group was six women and a borrowed machine, and its activities lead signed the county fund application that bought every overlocker the group owns.",
