  "lane_spec": "Handle: \"the misprint drawer\". Three concrete elements: the order of service with the bride name printed upside down, the harvest supper poster that went out with no date on it, the ticket run struck in entirely the wrong blue. Precedent as recurring institutional format with a witnessed body reaction: the scheme runs its toasts as three tellings and a raising, the same shape at every supper, and when she read three misprints at the spring supper Mr Pargeter set his glass down and did not pick it up until the end. Slot arithmetic: three misprints = three tellings, plus the raising = the entire toast; nothing beyond the slots is left to design.",
