  "lane_spec": "handle: \"the long table\" - elements: the trestles borrowed out of the church hall every single year, the urn that trips the fuse box at nine, the hand-lettered place cards with half the surnames spelled wrong - precedent: the welcome page runs the same shape at every intake, and the new fishmonger pinned last years copy above his slicer where it is still hanging - coverage: four short blocks, one per element and one closing joining line, so the whole packet page fills from the lane slots with nothing left to design",
